    "title": "打开一份虚拟文档",
    "text": "双击“文档编辑器”查看示例文档；也可以在文件浏览器中打开任意 .txt 文件。"
  },
  {
    "id": "open-terminal",
    "trigger": "tour:document_editor_opened",
    "completeOn": "tour:terminal_opened",
    "target": ".desktop-icon[data-icon-id=\"/home/desktop/终端.lnk\"]",
    "title": "试试虚拟终端",
    "text": "打开终端后输入 pwd、ls 或 cat 演示文档.txt，命令会通过虚拟文件系统运行。"
  },
  {
    "id": "open-inventory",
    "trigger": "tour:terminal_opened",
    "completeOn": "tour:inventory_opened",
    "target": ".desktop-icon[data-icon-id=\"/home/desktop/物品系统.lnk\"]",
    "title": "探索数据库物品",
    "text": "打开“物品系统”，每件物品来自示例数据库，并可查看调查内容。"
  },
  {
